- Project:    SiMolecule / centres
- Version:    1.5 (develop @ d4b3cf0, pom 1.5-SNAPSHOT; CDK 2.12). Shaded fat-jar
              produced by `mvn -pl cdk -am package -DskipTests`, vendored UNMODIFIED.
- Main-Class: com.simolecule.centres.LabelCip
- Size:       2,421,241 bytes.
